{"ref":"BDB, חֹלוֹן","hw":"חֹלוֹן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֹלוֹן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹלֹן</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  in Moab <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹלוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.21\">Je 48:21</a> (𝔊 Χελων, Χαιλων.<br><strong>2.</strong>  in Judah <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹלֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:51\" href=\"/Joshua.15.51\">Jos 15:51</a> (𝔊 Χαλου, 𝔊L Χειλου); priestly city <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:15\" href=\"/Joshua.21.15\">21:15</a> (𝔊 Γελλα, 𝔊L Ιλων) = <span dir=\"rtl\">חִילֵן</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:43\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.43\">1 Ch 6:43</a> (𝔊L Χελων).","next":"BDB, חֵלֹן","prev":"BDB, חִילֵן"}